# Backend

- Pydantic v2: `ConfigDict(extra="forbid")`, camelCase fields, `StrEnum`.
- Thin routers under `/api/v1`. Domain logic in `LeadService`.
- `Annotated` deps from `app.dependencies`. SQLite I/O via `run_in_thread`.
- Errors: `{"detail": {"error_code": "...", "message": "..."}, "request_id": "..."}`.
- Critical logs only: `lead_created`, `lead_status_updated`, `lead_activity_logged`, `db_operation_failed`.
- Parameterized SQL only. No `print()` for ops logs.
